      "init": {
        "label": "One equation, any direction",
        "body": "An **Equation** node has no fixed output: every variable is an input *and* an output. Leave exactly one unwired and it solves for it; wire them all and **Holds?** answers TRUE/FALSE. Edit any equation below or unwire a different variable to change what gets solved.",
